	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Parts Minion",
	"Description": "Bridge between GSTNParts and GSTNMinion (plan P15 to P16): destructible parts for minions, so hundreds of small enemies can lose a head and keep fighting. P16 sub-gate A: per-minion part rows (9 B) for part-bearing types, the hit flow glue (the same PartResolve step on a view built from the row, the outcome written back with no GE and no fragment, lethal parts kill through the normal minion death path); the wire byte and promotion copy come in sub-gate B. The pure pieces (8 part limit, FGSTN_PartsMinionExtension, the store to snapshot builder) live in GSTNPartsCore. Enabling it changes nothing for minion types without a registered extension.",
